* MINT-ERRORS: 10
* Ref: ../dbase3-decomp/specs/commands/set-commands.md:149
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
SET HISTORY TO 20
SET HISTORY ON
? "[DEFAULT DOHISTORY OFF]"
DO HISTOFF
LIST HISTORY
SET DOHISTORY ON
DO HISTON
SET DOHISTORY OFF
? "[DOHISTORY ON RECORDED NESTED COMMANDS]"
LIST HISTORY
? "[BAD TOGGLE]"
SET DOHISTORY MAYBE
? "[W2-END]"
RETURN
